 "text": "-->\nKG Agri Products, Inc. | KAPI | Soybeans | Seed\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nHOME\nGrow With Us\nResearch and Development\nContact Us\nOur Staff\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nKG Agri Products, Inc.\nNON-GMO / ORGANIC / FOOD GRADE\n​\nKAPI is looking for Ohio Non-GMO & Organic soybean\ngrowers for the 2027 crop season.\n​\nNon-GMO contract premiums start at $2.80 over COBT.\n​\nIf you have questions or interested in growing,\nplease reach out to one of our Field Sales Specialists.\n​\n​\n​\nGROW WITH US\nLearn More Today\nTop Quality\nTop Premiums\nKG Agri Products, Inc. (KAPI) takes pride in providing our contract growers with highly competitive varieties for production and the opportunity to increase their per acre income with outstanding premium and marketing programs.\nContract\nTODAY!\nOur Story\nOur business was started in 1986 with a shipment of 2 containers to Japan for evaluation as part of the Ohio Department of Development program for expanding exports from the state. Since that time KAPI has expanded to shipping containers world wide, as well as a large domestic customer base.\nOur soybean varieties used are developed exclusively by KAPI, and tested rigorously at multiple research and development locations.\nSoybeans processed by KAPI are used for a variety of products including, but not limited to: tofu, soymilk, and soy sauce.\n​\nKG Agri Products, Inc. takes pride in providing our contract growers with highly competitive varieties for production and the opportunity to increase their per acre income with outstanding premium and marketing programs.\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM\n@kgagriproducts\nContact\n20100 Johnson Road\nMarysville, OH 43040\n(937) 644-8215\nGrow With Us\nBenjamin Eggers\nField Sales Specialist\n(614)980-6752\nBenjamin_Eggers@kapi-ohio.com\n​\nChristopher Roe\nField Sales Specialist\n(937)243-2309\nChris_Roe@kapi-ohio.com\n© 2020 KG Agri Products, Inc.\nProudly created with Wix.com\nbottom of page",
